---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | RoamDawn" description="RoamDawn cookie policy explaining first-party and third-party cookies and similar technologies.">
<main class="cookies-page container max-w-3xl">
<p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
<p class="lead">RoamDawn does not currently use cookies for its own analytics or behavioral tracking. Third-party services may use cookies or similar technologies when they are enabled.</p>
<section><h2>Cookies used by RoamDawn</h2><p>We do not currently use first-party cookies for analytics, behavioral advertising or cross-site tracking.</p></section>
<section><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>When you click an affiliate link, you leave RoamDawn and visit the third-party provider. That provider or its affiliate network may use cookies or similar technologies to recognize the referral and attribute a commission. Those technologies are controlled by the third party and are subject to its own policies.</p></section>
<section><h2>Advertising</h2><p>RoamDawn may use Google AdSense or other advertising providers in the future. Advertising providers may use cookies, local storage or similar technologies for advertising delivery, measurement, fraud prevention and related purposes. When a provider requires consent, we will use the appropriate consent mechanism before enabling the relevant technology where required by law.</p></section>
<section><h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy will be updated if we introduce analytics, advertising, embedded services or other technologies that change how information is stored or accessed on your device.</p></section>
<section><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about cookies or privacy, email <a href="mailto:contact@roamdawn.info">contact@roamdawn.info</a> or visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p></section>
</main></BaseLayout>
<style>
.cookies-page{padding:48px 0 72px;color:#26343d}.eyebrow{margin:0;color:#287c8b;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}.cookies-page h1{margin:.65rem 0 1rem;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,6vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.1;color:#182b35}.lead{margin:0 0 38px;color:#68747b;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.75}.cookies-page section{padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e8e9}.cookies-page h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.3;color:#21343d}.cookies-page p{margin:0;color:#68747b;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8}.cookies-page a{color:#287c8b;font-weight:700}@media(max-width:640px){.cookies-page{padding:28px 0 55px}.cookies-page h1{font-size:2.35rem}.cookies-page h2{font-size:1.4rem}}
</style>